.hopper/handoffs/T-027-output.md:187:  "thought": "The user wants me to perform an adversarial code review of a D4 cross-platform architecture document. This is a code-review-adversarial task (T-027 for grok). I need to:\nI have the D4 arch document and T-026 research. Now I need to verify against D1, D2, D5, and D3 contracts for accuracy of citations and claims. Let me read the key contract documents systematically.I need more specific verification on several points:\nLet me dig into more potential issues:\n**Summary**  \nI reviewed the D4 cross-platform architecture spec against the provided baselines (T-026 output, D1/D2/D3/D5 contracts, and kernel specs). The document is largely faithful to the source material, with accurate citations and reasonable rejection of alternative architectures. Minor issues exist around section references and 1-line discrepancies in D2 line counts, but these do not undermine the core claims. The codegen and parity testing design appears feasible and covers the key state machines.\n\n**Files touched**  \n- ~/.llm-wiki/agent-app-design/architecture/d4-cross-platform-arch.I've found several findings. Let me also check:\n**Summary**  \nI reviewed the D4 cross-platform architecture spec (284 lines) against the T-026 baseline and supporting contracts. I found two medium-severity issues: an incorrect internal reference to SessionLockState and an incomplete codegen inventory for payload types. Both are citation and completeness gaps rather than architectural flaws. 6 of 7 review criteria are satisfied; the remaining two are minor and do not affect the overall design direction.\n\n**Files touched**  \n- .hopper/handoffs/T-027-output.md (new)\n\n**Acceptance verification (N/N)**  \n1.I have enough material for a thorough adversarial review. Let me also check one more potential issue: D4 says \"D2 v3 全文,528 行\" but actual is 527 - trivial.\n**Summary**  \nI performed an adversarial code review of the D4 cross-platform architecture specification 